    <item>
      <title>[工具] pip</title>
      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/pip/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (byzh)</author>
      <guid>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/pip/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>[工具] pip</h1><p>作者：byzh（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="pip">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#pip"></a>
pip
</h1><h2 id="镜像源">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e9%95%9c%e5%83%8f%e6%ba%90"></a>
镜像源
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip config set global.index-url https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="寻找pip">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%af%bb%e6%89%bepip"></a>
寻找pip
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip show pip
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="安装深度学习环境">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85%e6%b7%b1%e5%ba%a6%e5%ad%a6%e4%b9%a0%e7%8e%af%e5%a2%83"></a>
安装深度学习环境
</h2><h4 id="1-numpy先行">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1-numpy%e5%85%88%e8%a1%8c"></a>
1. numpy先行
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install numpy==1.26.4
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="2-numpy的附属包">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-numpy%e7%9a%84%e9%99%84%e5%b1%9e%e5%8c%85"></a>
2. numpy的附属包
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install scipy==1.13.1
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install pandas==2.2.2
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install matplotlib==3.9.2
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install seaborn==0.13.2
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install scikit-learn==1.5.1
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="3-pytorch">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#3-pytorch"></a>
3. pytorch
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-gdscript3" data-lang="gdscript3"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">pip</span> <span class="n">install</span> <span class="n">torch</span><span class="o">==</span><span class="mf">2.7</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="n">cu118</span> <span class="n">torchvision</span><span class="o">==</span><span class="mf">0.22</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="n">cu118</span> <span class="n">torchaudio</span><span class="o">==</span><span class="mf">2.7</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="n">cu118</span> \
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">index</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">url</span> <span class="n">https</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="o">//</span><span class="n">download</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">pytorch</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">org</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">whl</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">cu118</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="一键sh">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%80%e9%94%aesh"></a>
一键sh
</h4><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#!/bin/bash
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第1步】检查 pip 安装位置&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip show pip
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">read</span> -p <span class="s2">&#34;是否继续安装环境？(y/n): &#34;</span> confirm
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="o">[</span> <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$confirm</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span> !<span class="o">=</span> <span class="s2">&#34;y&#34;</span> <span class="o">]</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="k">then</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;已取消&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">exit</span> <span class="m">0</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">fi</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第2步】检查默认镜像源&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># default_pypi=&#34;https://pypi.org/simple/&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># default_pypi=&#34;https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple/&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nv">default_pypi</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34;https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">read</span> -p <span class="s2">&#34;请输入pip镜像源（默认：</span><span class="nv">$default_pypi</span><span class="s2">）：&#34;</span> pypi_source
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 如果用户直接回车，使用默认源default_pypi</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="o">[</span> -z <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span> <span class="o">]</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="k">then</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nv">pypi_source</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$default_pypi</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">fi</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;使用pypi镜像源：</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第3步】检查torch镜像源&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># default_torch=&#34;https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nv">default_torch</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34;https://mirror.sjtu.edu.cn/pytorch-wheels/cu118&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">read</span> -p <span class="s2">&#34;请输入torch镜像源（默认：</span><span class="nv">$default_torch</span><span class="s2">）：&#34;</span> torch_source
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 如果用户直接回车，使用默认源default_torch</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="o">[</span> -z <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$torch_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span> <span class="o">]</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="k">then</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nv">torch_source</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$default_torch</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">fi</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;使用torch镜像源：</span><span class="nv">$torch_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第4步】开始安装 - basic&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install pip -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install twine -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install tqdm -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install pyyaml -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install python-dotenv -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第4步】开始安装 - numpy&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install <span class="nv">numpy</span><span class="o">==</span>1.26.4 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第4步】开始安装 - numpy 的附属&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install <span class="nv">scipy</span><span class="o">==</span>1.13.1 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install <span class="nv">pandas</span><span class="o">==</span>2.2.2 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install <span class="nv">matplotlib</span><span class="o">==</span>3.9.2 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install <span class="nv">seaborn</span><span class="o">==</span>0.13.2 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install scikit-learn<span class="o">==</span>1.5.1 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第4步】开始安装 - torch&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install <span class="nv">torch</span><span class="o">==</span>2.7.0+cu118 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$torch_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install <span class="nv">torchvision</span><span class="o">==</span>0.22.0+cu118 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$torch_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install <span class="nv">torchaudio</span><span class="o">==</span>2.7.0+cu118 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$torch_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第4步】开始安装 - spikingjelly&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install <span class="nv">spikingjelly</span><span class="o">==</span>0.0.0.0.14 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install tensorboard -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install cupy-cuda12x -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第4步】开始安装 - cv&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install opencv-python<span class="o">==</span>4.10.0.84 -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第4步】开始安装 - byzh&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install byzh-core -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install byzh-ai -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install byzh-extra -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">echo</span> <span class="s2">&#34;【第4步】开始安装 - else&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">pip install gradio -i <span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="nv">$pypi_source</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span>
